{"unit_id":"tag:022C:proof","translation":"我们证明 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），其余结论再由引理<REF_0001>得出。设<MATH_0001>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）。按定义，这意味着<MATH_0002>平坦（flat），从而验证了定义<REF_0002>的第一个条件。为核对第二个条件，设<MATH_0003>是仿射开（affine open）子集（subset）。写成<MATH_0004>，其中<MATH_0005>是某些仿射开集（affine opens）。由于每个<MATH_0006>都是开的（open）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>），可知<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>的开覆盖（covering）。由于<MATH_0009>拟紧（quasi-compact），这个覆盖（covering）有有限（finite）加细（refinement）。证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"affine opens","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine opens","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:022A:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nfpqc<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>字母 fpqc 代表“忠实平坦拟紧（fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat quasi-compacte）”。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\n拓扑（topology）不能用处理 fppf 拓扑（topology）的同样方式处理<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0002>更精确地说，引理<REF_0001>对 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）的类似陈述不成立。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0002>。具体地，假设<MATH_0001>是非零环（ring）。我们将在引理<REF_0002>中看到，不存在集合（set）<MATH_0002>，由<MATH_0003>的 fpqc 覆盖（coverings）组成，使得每个 fpqc 覆盖（covering）都可由<MATH_0004>的一个元素（element）加细。若<MATH_0005>是域（field），则这种无界性（unboundedness）的原因是：不存在<MATH_0006>的域（field）扩张（extension），使得<MATH_0007>的每个域（field）扩张（extension）都包含在其中。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n若忽略集合（set）论困难，就会遇到没有层化（sheafification）的预层（presheaves），见<REF_0003>。一个稍有意思的选择是，只考虑那些忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环（ring）扩张（extensions）<MATH_0008>，其中<MATH_0009>的基数（cardinality）有适当的界。（而若像 SGA4 中那样，考虑固定宇宙（universe）中的所有概形（schemes），就等于以一个强不可达（strongly inaccessible）基数（cardinal）来限制基数（cardinality）。）不过，若将基数（cardinal）换成更大的一个，情形如何并不那么清楚。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n出于这些原因，我们不引入 fpqc 景（sites），也不考虑关于 fpqc 拓扑（topology）的上同调（cohomology）。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n另一方面，给定反变函子（contravariant functor）<MATH_0010>，问<MATH_0011>是否满足 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）的层性质（sheaf property）是有意义的，见下文。此外，也可以讨论 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）中对象（object）的下降（descent），等等。简单地说，对某些结果，正确的一般性是使用 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings）。\n\n","allowed_english":["fpqc","fppf","SGA"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat quasi-compacte","target_term":"忠实平坦拟紧"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"unboundedness","target_term":"无界性"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"宇宙"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"strongly inaccessible","target_term":"强不可达"},{"source_term":"cardinal","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"cardinal","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat quasi-compacte","target_term":"忠实平坦拟紧","context":"fpqc 法语全称，待决"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"unboundedness","target_term":"无界性","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"宇宙","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"strongly inaccessible","target_term":"强不可达","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"cardinal","target_term":"基数","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:022D:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），它覆盖<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>有 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且<MATH_0010>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:022D:proof","translation":"(1) 是立即得到的。回顾平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）仍平坦（flat），且平坦（flat）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）仍平坦（flat）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>）。因此，在每种情形中，可应用引理<REF_0003>核对我们的态射族（families of morphisms）是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n(2) 的证明。假设<MATH_0001>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且对每个<MATH_0002>有 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>是仿射开集（affine open）。可找到拟紧（quasi-compact）开集<MATH_0005>，对<MATH_0006>给出，几乎全部为空（empty），使得<MATH_0007>。随后，对每个<MATH_0008>，可选择拟紧（quasi-compact）开集<MATH_0009>，对<MATH_0010>给出，几乎全部为空（empty），满足<MATH_0011>。因此<MATH_0012>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n(3) 的证明。假设<MATH_0013>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且<MATH_0014>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0015>是仿射开集（affine open），映入（maps）仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0016>。选择拟紧（quasi-compact）开集<MATH_0017>，几乎全部为空（empty），使得<MATH_0018>。则<MATH_0019>是<MATH_0020>的拟紧开集（quasi-compact open），且<MATH_0021>。由于<MATH_0022>可由这样的仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0023>覆盖，可知<MATH_0024>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），这是引理<REF_0004>的结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"fpqc cove