{"unit_id":"tag:022F:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准 fpqc 覆盖（standard fpqc covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，它覆盖<MATH_0002>，是族（family）<MATH_0003>，满足每个<MATH_0004>都仿射（affine），在<MATH_0005>上平坦（flat），且<MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"standard fpqc covering","target_term":"标准 fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"standard fpqc covering","target_term":"标准 fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:022A:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由于不引入仿射（affine）景（site），必须直接证明所有标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings）的全体满足公理。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03LA:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），它覆盖<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>有标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且<MATH_0010>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03LA:proof","translation":"这形式地由以下事实得出：平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）的复合（compositions）和基变换（base changes）仍平坦（flat）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>），且仿射概形（affine schemes）的纤维积（fibre products）仍仿射（affine）（《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0003>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"复合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03LB:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）之间的态射族（family of morphisms），其目标为<MATH_0003>。假设：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 每个<MATH_0004>都平坦（flat），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0005>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，存在标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0007>，加细（refines）族（family）<MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0009>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），它覆盖<MATH_0010>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03LB:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）。对每个<MATH_0002>，拉回（pullback）族（family）<MATH_0003>可由标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）加细，因此由引理<REF_0001>知，它是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。由于<MATH_0004>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），得出<MATH_0005>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），这是引理<REF_0002>的结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:022G:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是反变函子（contravariant functor），定义在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上，取值于集合（sets）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>是态射族（family of morphisms），由概形（schemes）之间的态射组成，并有固定目标。称<MATH_0003><TEXTITOPEN_0001>对给定族满足层性质（satisfies the sheaf property for the given family）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若对任意一组元素（elements）<MATH_0004>，满足<MATH_0005>，都存在唯一的元素（element）<MATH_0006>，使得<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>中成立。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0009><TEXTITOPEN_0002>对 fpqc 拓扑满足层性质（satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若它对任意 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）满足层性质（sheaf property）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"satisfies the sheaf property for the given family","target_term":"对给定族满足层性质"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology","target_term":"对 fpqc 拓扑满足层性质"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"satisfies the sheaf property for the given family","target_term":"对给定族满足层性质","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"satisfies the sheaf property for the fpqc topology","target_term":"对 fpqc 拓扑满足层性质","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
